rte.","en":"It depends on how strong it is.","words":[null,{"g":"from"},{"g":"how much, however much"},{"g":"is","l":"essere"},{"g":"strong"}]},{"text":"Può dipendere dal suo aiuto.","en":"You can depend on his help.","words":[{"g":"can, could","l":"potere"},null,{"g":"since"},{"g":"his, hers, its"},{"g":"help, assistance, aid"}]},{"text":"Non dipenda troppo dagli altri.","en":"Don't depend too much on others.","words":[{"g":"not"},null,{"g":"too much"},null,{"g":"other","l":"altro"}]}]}